      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1762df44f08ade09\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe Tokyo Tower was the tallest lattice tower in the world for 16 years, from <strong>1957 to 1973</strong>, and remains the tallest four-sided lattice tower.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1762df44f08ade09\">>>",
